# Selection Market Research

A personal learning project for understanding Etsy marketplace data.

## What it does

A read-only research tool I use for my own study of Etsy public listings. It reads publicly visible listing data only (title, price, discount, sales estimate) through the official Etsy API, in read-only mode, to learn how product pricing and demand patterns work on the marketplace.

## Data usage

- Public data only
- Accessed through the official Etsy API 
- Read-only, never writes or modifies any listing
- Personal use, not distributed to others

## Who it's for

The author only, for personal research and learning.
